WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:05.465
Clone ORNL/oscar-regression, run npm ci and npm run install:browser, then run npm run check and npm test to verify all 246 unit tests.

2
00:00:05.505 --> 00:00:11.107
Configure .env with target, emulator, lane-mapping, and DISPOSABLE-STORAGE acknowledgements, and use rebind-active-release.sh after upgrades.

3
00:00:11.147 --> 00:00:16.747
Run smoke, full, restore-drill, or ui-endurance—or pass --scenario to target individual modules across the regression suite.

4
00:00:16.787 --> 00:00:22.582
Inspect results/<run-id>/summary.md, functional-results.csv, performance.csv, and evidence/ screenshots; exit code 0 requires zero incorrect checks.
